ir imaginary parts.\n\nFor the given problem, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(8-\\sqrt{-4})-(-7+\\sqrt{-49}) & =(8-2\\,\\text{i})-(-7+7\\,\\text{i}) \\\\  & =(8-(-7))+(-2-7)\\,\\text{i} \\\\  & =(8+7)-9\\,\\text{i} \\\\  & =15-9\\,\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055454 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054621 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "182eba72-4c11-5e90-8533-77cf3cd86f4c" :knowledge-point/title "Adding Purely Imaginary Numbers"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07c3e071-9981-54b0-a37f-1ac68b832cca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5\\,\\text{i}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513552} {:answer/id #uuid "2579f201-b32d-5e4d-8992-d2d1d9d6da62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\,\\text{i}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513637} {:answer/id #uuid "4ee5568d-f299-5e9d-a5de-8fe35d08ac54" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6\\,\\text{i}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513748} {:answer/id #uuid "cdf1c958-dea0-587f-b51c-d8fe3c4f42df" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5\\,\\text{i}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186514067} {:answer/id #uuid "d88c9e27-515a-5605-86dd-ff88c6464b8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\,\\text{i}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186514099}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2579f201-b32d-5e4d-8992-d2d1d9d6da62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\,\\text{i}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513637} :answer-field/id #uuid "8c8a5bd8-03fc-5a74-b861-d63c11fa8d61" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186053961}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "364e62b3-17d8-5120-8d1a-de45f9f1ea81" :question/math-academy-id "q-66351" :question/problem "$-5\\,\\text{i}+\\text{i}=$" :question/worked-solution "To add or subtract complex numbers, we add or subtract their real parts, and we add or subtract their imaginary parts.\n\nIn this case, $-5\\,\\text{i}$ and $\\text{i}$ are purely imaginary numbers. Therefore, we only need to add their imaginary parts, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5\\,\\text{i}+\\text{i} & =-5\\,\\text{i}+1\\,\\text{i}=(-5+1)\\,\\text{i}=-4\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
